          "caption": "The Puggy Line A remnant of the famed Lochaber narrow gauge railway built to support the tunnel works between Loch Treig and the Fort William Aluminium smelter hydro electric scheme in the 1920's.The whole thing is an impressive feat of Civil Engineering.\nFor more info read, The Puggy Line by Patrick Howat.",
